graph TD
  accTitle: Proposed twenty-second scan-area demonstration, not a working-demo receipt
  accDescr: Proposed storyboard only, not measured runtime or an operational result. A human Chief approves scanning an area. Three simulated drones collect visible pixels from an open vantage. Every drone would have a synthetic thermal feed with optional EO. Analysis flags a possible person, explicitly unverified. The crew shares an evidence pin, reviews it, and may approve a revised simulated task. No through-wall vision, calibrated temperatures, confirmed identification, or lives-saved claim.

  subgraph COLLECTION["PROPOSED collection"]
    direction LR
    REQUEST["Crew request<br/>Scan this area"]
    REVIEW["Chief approves<br/>Finite scope"]
    DRONES["Three sim drones<br/>Open vantage"]
    FRAME["Exercise frame<br/>Synthetic thermal"]
    REQUEST --> REVIEW --> DRONES --> FRAME
  end
  subgraph REVIEW_STAGE["PROPOSED review"]
    direction LR
    FINDING["Possible person<br/>Unverified"]
    MAP["Exercise map marker<br/>Source + clocks"]
    HUMAN["Crew reviews<br/>Chief revises scope"]
    FINDING --> MAP --> HUMAN
  end
  COLLECTION --> REVIEW_STAGE

  classDef proposed fill:#fafafa,stroke:#7d7d7d,stroke-width:1.5px,stroke-dasharray:2 4,color:#171717;
  class REQUEST,REVIEW,DRONES,FRAME,FINDING,MAP,HUMAN proposed;
  style COLLECTION fill:#ffffff,stroke:#7d7d7d,stroke-dasharray:2 4
  style REVIEW_STAGE fill:#ffffff,stroke:#7d7d7d,stroke-dasharray:2 4
